Emails (Resend) for: verify email, invite, sync failed (rate-limited to avoid spam), connection needs reconnect, conflicts waiting, trial ending, payment failed, export ready. In-app toasts and a notification bell are a nice-to-have, not required.

## 12. NON-FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS
- Performance: dashboard loads in <2s on 100 syncs; a sync of 5,000 records completes in <5 min under normal vendor rate limits; large reads are paginated and processed in chunks (no loading everything into memory).
- Reliability: every job is idempotent and resumable from its cursor; a crashed run can be resumed or marked failed without duplicates.
- Observability: each run has a correlation id included in all logs; Sentry captures job and API errors.
- Accessibility: keyboard navigation, labels, focus states, and reduced-motion respect.
- Code quality: strict TypeScript, ESLint + Prettier, no `any` in the engine and connectors, and meaningful unit tests for the engine (conflict rules, loop prevention, idempotency, transformations, filters).

